Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 17:53:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 515/913] core: lib: scmi-server: remove support of stm32mp1x

STM32MP1x does not support anymore SCPFw as SCMI server.
Remove useless file.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git bf3251f5a801fade7c72f3ab0d0ec4b370bba0c3 core: lib: scmi-server: remove support of stm32mp1x]
Signed-off-by: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I9be492aa4004415d451b06cf2ac5adc34b52b4f0
---
 core/lib/scmi-server/conf-optee-stm32mp1.mk | 22 ---------------------
 1 file changed, 22 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 core/lib/scmi-server/conf-optee-stm32mp1.mk

diff --git a/core/lib/scmi-server/conf-optee-stm32mp1.mk b/core/lib/scmi-server/conf-optee-stm32mp1.mk
